{"id":"n69473-1-10","stage":1,"title":"물어보다 · 问","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69473-1-10-1","ko":"지수야, 네가 지난번에 말했던 영화 제목이 뭐였지?","zh":"智秀啊，你上次说的那部电影的标题叫什么来着？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지난번에","meaning":"上次，上回","explanation":"지난번：上次，上回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지난번","audio":"/audio/0c2f1df517822c1fb603.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71316","senseId":"1","lemma":"지난번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말했던","meaning":"说，讲","explanation":"말하다：说，讲；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"말하다","audio":"/audio/f70cb61c1b19f1388e68.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62103","senseId":"1","lemma":"말하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영화","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제목이","meaning":"题目","explanation":"제목：题目；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"제목","audio":"/audio/08b17e433630742bc700.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70897","senseId":"1","lemma":"제목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐였지?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"0c2f1df517822c1f","term":"지난번","zh":"上次，上回","audio":"/audio/0c2f1df517822c1fb603.mp3","entryId":"71316","definition":"以正在说话时为准，指过去的时候。","pronunciation":["지난번"]},{"id":"f70cb61c1b19f138","term":"말하다","zh":"说，讲","audio":"/audio/f70cb61c1b19f1388e68.mp3","entryId":"62103","definition":"用话语表达某种事实、自己的想法或感觉等。","pronunciation":["말ː하다"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"08b17e433630742b","term":"제목","zh":"题目","audio":"/audio/08b17e433630742bc700.mp3","entryId":"70897","definition":"文章、电影或公演等中，为表达中心内容而取的名字。","pronunciation":["제목"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/3ebecc55c883af423b8f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69473-1-10-2","ko":"갑자기 물어보니까 생각이 잘 안 나네.","zh":"突然这么一问，我怎么想不起来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물어보니까","meaning":"问，打听","explanation":"물어보다：问，打听；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"물어보다","audio":"/audio/d3dc601f766896a3ecf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69473","senseId":"1","lemma":"물어보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각이","meaning":"回想，记忆","explanation":"생각：回想，记忆；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"2","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나네.","meaning":"想起，想到","explanation":"나다：想起，想到；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"21","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"d3dc601f766896a3","term":"물어보다","zh":"问，打听","audio":"/audio/d3dc601f766896a3ecf1.mp3","entryId":"69473","definition":"为弄清某事而发问。","pronunciation":["무러보다"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"回想，记忆","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"对某事的回忆。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"容易","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"性质或倾向较易成为某种状态或进行某种行动地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"想起，想到","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"想法或记忆等浮现。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/18778eced271ef41524a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.805,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69473","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":52,"sequenceScore":2.3571,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["智秀啊，你上次说的那部电影的标题叫什么来着？","突然这么一问，我怎么想不起来了。","你做了卷发啊。是在哪家理发店做的？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["智秀啊，你上次说的那部电影的标题叫什么来着？","突然这么一问，我怎么想不起来了。","你做了卷发啊。是在哪家理发店做的？"],"answer":1}]}
